---

Portions of this software are derived from the R package `cvequality`
(https://github.com/benmarwick/cvequality), which is likewise MIT licensed:

    Copyright (c) 2016 Ben Marwick & Kalimuthu Krishnamoorthy

In particular, `src/cvequality/reference.py` is a direct transcription of that
package's `R/functions.R`, and `tests/r/generate_fixtures.R` calls into it to
produce validation ground truth. This project is an independent port and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the original authors.

The statistical methods implemented here are due to:

    Feltz CJ, Miller GE (1996). An asymptotic test for the equality of
    coefficients of variation from k populations. Statistics in Medicine
    15:647-658.

    Krishnamoorthy K, Lee M (2014). Improved tests for the equality of normal
    coefficients of variation. Computational Statistics 29:215-232.
